1. The numeric goal_offset formula has FIVE sites, not three as docs/SIGNED_AOT_RECOVERY.md:54 claimed. The
   emitter's own manifest JSON carries it at out/jak-project/tools/ottsel_a1_1/a11_module_emitter.h:276,
